French Craftsmanship. Commercial Discipline. Exceptional Products.", "advertiser": {"id": "62531232", "description": "le louvre patisserie", "__typename": "JobSearchV6Advertiser"}, "branding": null, "companyName": "Le Louvre Patisserie", "currencyLabel": null, "employer": {"id": "745493", "name": "Le Louvre Patisserie", "companyId": null, "companyUrl": null, "__typename": "JobSearchV6Employer"}, "bulletPoints": [], "salaryLabel": "", "listingDate": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-08-25T06:01:38.000Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "locations": [{"label": "Jakarta Selatan, Jakarta Raya", "countryCode": "ID", "seoHierarchy": [{"contextualName": "Jakarta Selatan Jakarta Raya", "__typename": "JobSearchV6SeoHierarchy"}, {"contextualName": "Jakarta Raya", "__typename": "JobSearchV6SeoHierarchy"}], "__typename": "JobSearchV6DataLocation"}], "roleId": "Executive-Pastry-Chef", "tags": [{"label": "Jadilah pelamar pertama", "type": "EARLY_APPLICANT", "__typename": "JobSearchV6DataTag"}], "workArrangements": {"displayText": null, "__typename": "JobSearchV6WorkArrangements"}, "workTypes": ["Full time"], "classifications": [{"classification": {"description": "Hospitaliti & Pariwisata", "__typename": "JobSearchV6ClassificationDetail"}, "__typename": "JobSearchV6Classification"}], "__typename": "JobSearchV6Data", "_details": {"job": {"sourceZone": "asia-4", "id": "94193567", "title": "Executive Chef / Executive Pastry Chef / Sous Chef", "abstract": "LE LOUVRE PATISSERIE

French Craftsmanship. Commercial Discipline. Exceptional Products.", "content2": "<p><strong>WE ARE HIRING</strong></p><p><strong>Executive Chef / Executive Pastry Chef / Sous Chef</strong></p><p><strong>Le Louvre Patisserie</strong></p><p>Company: PT Cipta Kreatif Profesional<br>Brand: Le Louvre Patisserie<br>Location: South Jakarta<br></p><p>Le Louvre Patisserie is looking for an experienced, disciplined, commercially minded Executive Chef / Executive Pastry Chef to lead our culinary and pastry production operation.</p><p>This is a leadership position for a chef who can combine French pastry craftsmanship, production discipline, product innovation, food-cost control, team leadership, and commercial execution.</p><p>The successful candidate will be responsible not only for creating excellent products, but also for building a production system that delivers consistent quality, controlled costs, efficient output, and products that customers want to purchase repeatedly.</p><p><strong>CORE OBJECTIVE</strong></p><p>To lead and develop the complete culinary, bakery, pastry, viennoiserie, and production operation of Le Louvre Patisserie, ensuring exceptional product quality, consistency, innovation, food safety, profitability, production efficiency, and team performance.</p><p>The Executive Chef / Executive Pastry Chef will transform Le Louvre’s French artisan positioning into commercially successful products while maintaining strict standards for recipe execution, yield, food cost, waste, inventory, hygiene, and production capacity.</p><p><strong>KEY RESPONSIBILITIES</strong></p><ul><li><p>Lead the overall pastry, bakery, viennoiserie, cake, dessert, and relevant kitchen production teams.</p></li><li><p>Maintain authentic French-inspired craftsmanship and premium product standards.</p></li><li><p>Develop, standardize, and document recipes, production methods, SOPs, plating, finishing, and presentation standards.</p></li><li><p>Lead new-product development, seasonal menus, signature products, retail products, frozen products, catering, corporate orders, weddings, and special events.</p></li><li><p>Build daily, weekly, and monthly production plans based on forecasted sales and confirmed orders.</p></li><li><p>Ensure every product has an approved recipe, gram specification, yield, portion size, shelf life, storage method, and product-cost calculation.</p></li><li><p>Control food cost, ingredient usage, production yield, waste, remake, spoilage, and variance.</p></li><li><p>Coordinate purchasing requirements and maintain appropriate par-stock levels.</p></li><li><p>Implement FIFO/FEFO, labeling, batch coding, traceability, and inventory controls.</p></li><li><p>Maintain strict hygiene, sanitation, HACCP-oriented practices, allergen controls, and food-safety standards.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>QUALIFICATIONS</strong></p><ul><li><p>Minimum 5 years of professional pastry, bakery, or culinary experience, with substantial experience in a senior leadership position.</p></li><li><p>Proven experience as an Executive Pastry Chef, Head Pastry Chef, Executive Chef, Pastry Sous Chef, or equivalent senior production leader.</p></li><li><p>Strong technical expertise in French pastry, bakery, viennoiserie, cake, dessert, or related artisan production.</p></li><li><p>Strong knowledge of recipe standardization, food costing, yield, portion control, inventory, and waste management.</p></li><li><p>Demonstrated ability to manage production volume without compromising product quality.</p></li><li><p>Strong leadership, communication, coaching, and team-management capability.</p></li><li><p>Capable of developing commercial products, not only showcase products.</p></li><li><p>Strong understanding of hygiene, sanitation, food safety, storage, labeling, and shelf-life control.</p></li><li><p>Able to work under pressure and manage peak production periods.</p></li><li><p>Highly disciplined, responsible, honest, detail-oriented, and solution-focused.</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working with management targets, KPIs, production reports, and cost controls.</p></li><li><p>Able to collaborate with Marketing, Sales, Events, Finance, Costing, and Operations.</p></li><li><p>Experience in premium bakery, pâtisserie, hotel, restaurant, or artisan bakery operations is highly preferred.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR</strong></p><p>We are looking for a chef who can be both a craftsperson and an operator.</p><p>Someone who can create an outstanding croissant—but also explain its food cost, yield, production capacity, shelf life, waste risk, selling price, and how the team can reproduce it consistently every day.</p><p>Someone who can develop beautiful products—but also build the systems, discipline, and team required to grow a serious French bakery business.</p><p><strong>HOW TO APPLY</strong></p><p><strong>Klik Apply here in Jobstreet &amp; send:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Updated CV / Résume &amp; Current professional photograph</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Portfolio of pastry, bakery, cake, or culinary work</p></li><li><p>Examples of products personally developed</p></li><li><p>Current salary &amp; Expected salary</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Earliest availability</p></li></ul><p><strong><br>WhatsApp: <a href="tel:0811-8803-6361" aria-label="Phone number partially hidden" data-contact-match="0811-8803-6361" data-contact-match-masked="true">08••-••••-•361</a></strong></p><p><strong>Subject: Application – Executive Chef / Executive Pastry Chef</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p>", "status": "Active", "isExpired": false, "isLinkOut": false, "isVerified": true, "expiresAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-09-24T13:59:59.999Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "listedAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-08-25T06:01:38.700Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "salary": null, "workTypes": {"label": "Full time", "__typename": "JobWorkTypes"}, "advertiser": {"id": "62531232", "name": "le louvre patisserie", "isVerif